    {
      "id": 3,
      "url": "https://dlmf.nist.gov/25.9",
      "title": "DLMF 25.9, AFE and chi, archived formula-preserving source",
      "accessed": "2026-09-12",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "text": "If  $x\\geq 1$ ,  $y\\geq 1$ ,  $2\\pi xy=t$ , and  $0\\leq\\sigma\\leq 1$ , then as",
          "added": "2026-09-12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Titchmarsh (1986b, (4.12.4), p. 79)",
          "added": "2026-09-12"
        },
        {
          "text": "\\[\\zeta\\left(\\sigma+it\\right)=\\sum_{1\\leq n\\leq x}\\frac{1}{n^{s}}+\\chi(s)\\sum_{1%\n\\leq n\\leq y}\\frac{1}{n^{1-s}}+O\\left(x^{-\\sigma}\\right)+O\\left(y^{\\sigma-1}t^%\n{\\frac{1}{2}-\\sigma}\\right),\\]",
          "added": "2026-09-12"
        },
        {
          "text": "where  $s=\\sigma+it$  and\n25.9.2\n$\\chi(s)\\equiv\\pi^{s-\\frac{1}{2}}\\Gamma\\left(\\tfrac{1}{2}-\\tfrac{1}{2}s\\right)/%\n\\Gamma\\left(\\tfrac{1}{2}s\\right).$",
          "added": "2026-09-12"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/src/2006.04060v2",
      "title": "GMRR v2, archived TeX, Lemmas 3 and 7",
      "accessed": "2026-09-12",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "text": "Let $a(n)$ be an arbitrary sequence of coefficients and $N, q \\geq 1$ be integers and $T \\geq 1$ real.",
          "added": "2026-09-12"
        },
        {
          "text": "\\int_{|t| \\leq T} |\\zeta(\\tfrac 12 + it)|^4 dt \\ll T (\\log T)^4.",
          "added": "2026-09-12"
        },
        {
          "text": "\\sum_{\\chi \\Mod{q}} \\int_{|t| \\leq T} \\Big | \\sum_{n \\leq N} a(n) \\chi^2(n) n^{it} \\Big |^2 dt \\ll q^{\\varepsilon} (q T + N) \\sum_{n \\leq N} |a(n)|^2.",
          "added": "2026-09-12"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
